      "title": "USB HID: Avoid allocating a huge amount of memory (second try).",
      "message": "USB HID: Avoid allocating a huge amount of memory (second try).\n\n10204490d7 / MR 80 ensured that we didn't grow field.usages due to an\nunderflow, but it neglected to check for a sane array size. Add another\ncheck to make sure we don't wmem_array_grow() too much. Fixes #17165 and\nfixes #16809 more completely.\n",
      "author_name": "Gerald Combs",
      "author_email": "gerald@wireshark.org",
      "authored_date": "2021-01-25T13:41:38.000-08:00",
      "committer_name": "AndersBroman",
      "committer_email": "a.broman58@gmail.com",
